␀T␀h␀i␀s␀ ␀i␀s␀ ␀t␀h␀e␀ ␀u␀p␀d␀a␀t␀e␀d␀ ␀v␀e␀r␀s␀i␀o␀n␀ ␀f␀r␀o␀m␀ ␀2␀0␀1␀8␀,␀ ␀f␀e␀a␀t␀u␀r␀i␀n␀g␀ ␀i␀m␀p␀r␀o␀v␀e␀m␀e␀n␀t␀s␀ ␀o␀n␀ ␀G␀r␀e␀e␀k␀ ␀a␀n␀d␀ ␀C␀y␀r␀i␀l␀l␀i␀c␀ ␀s␀c␀r␀i␀p␀t␀ ␀p␀l␀u␀s␀ ␀o␀v␀e␀r␀a␀l␀l␀ ␀K␀e␀r␀n␀i␀n␀g␀ ␀u␀p␀d␀a␀t␀e␀s␀.␀␀The pan-European Cera Collection is driven by pure geometry and contains the bestselling Cera plus Cera Condensed, its stenciled counterpart Cera Stencil, the hand-crafted display companion Cera Brush and soft Cera Round.

